  <compounddef id="Frame-based-example" kind="example">
    <compoundname>Frame-based</compoundname>
    <briefdescription>
<para>allocation pattern </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>allocation pattern <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">auto<sp/>arena<sp/>=<sp/>cslt::move(cslt::ArenaAllocator::Heap(1024<sp/>*<sp/>1024).value());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">while<sp/>(running)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Allocate<sp/>temporary<sp/>data<sp/>for<sp/>this<sp/>frame</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>auto<sp/>temp_data<sp/>=<sp/>arena-&gt;alloc(4096).value();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>process_frame(temp_data);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Free<sp/>all<sp/>frame<sp/>allocations<sp/>at<sp/>once<sp/>(very<sp/>fast!)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>arena-&gt;reset();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>save() To create checkpoint before temporary allocations </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>restore() To rollback to checkpoint instead of full reset <programlisting filename="Frame-based"></programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
    <location file="/home/jonwebb/Code_Dev/C++/csalt++/csalt++/include/allocator.hpp"/>
  </compounddef>
